==== TSPO-PET Imaging

    - #super[11]C-PBR28 or #super[18]F-DPA-714 radioligand (second-generation TSPO tracers)
    - rs6971 genotype measured for every participant; primary analysis restricted to high-affinity binders
    - Pre-specified primary region of interest: anterior cingulate cortex
    - Secondary regions: hippocampus, amygdala, thalamus, brainstem (pons and medulla), prefrontal cortex
    - Quantification: total distribution volume ($V_T$) with arterial input where available; partial-volume correction
    - Standardised uptake value ratio as a sensitivity analysis only
    - Voxel-wise analysis with false-discovery-rate correction; exploratory and reported separately
    - Genotype composition and tracer generation reported with every result
